# Single repo local dev

- **Only checkout:** `b:\Neo Pulse\pulse` (remote: `https://github.com/neodigitalca/Google-Ads.git`).
- **Do not** start or debug Vite from `B:\Neo Pulse\Google-Ads-main` or any other clone on port **8080**.
- **Start stack:** `start-neopulse-local.bat` or `npm run start:local` / `npm run dev` from **this** repo root.
- **Do not** use raw `npx vite`; use `scripts/dev.cjs` (via `npm run dev`). Dev `/api` always targets **neopulse.local**, not production.
